⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of The Unmaker
node C1 · C1 · ⟦The Unmaker:C1:b72af4⟧

WHO   — The Unmaker — the Nothing that hungers
WHAT  — The Unmaker — the entropy that hates all order, pattern, and life; the great antagonist of *The Tales of Alvin Maker* that labors through fear and through men to pull everything that is built back down into nothing.
WHERE — C1 · Card  Framework inputs: The Tales of Alvin Maker  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because all order is an affront to it; because where the Maker mends, the Unmaker must break; because it cannot create and so it can only crave the end of everything that lives, loves, and is whole.
HOW   — By having no body and needing none — working through men like Calvin and the Finders, through fear and greed and despair, through the slow cold cracking that pulls iron, flesh, and faith toward dissolution.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  The Unmaker builds nothing and breaks all — and yet for every wall it cracks, a Maker is born to mend; it is the dark the light is measured against.

